- Brackets (extensible to single/double elimination)
- Match lifecycle states
- Prize pools
- Country eligibility
- Whitelisting
- Discord integration references
- Secure match reporting
- Admin validation flow

Edge Functions required for:
- Registration validation
- Match result submission
- Bracket progression logic
- ELO updates

Competitive integrity is priority.

---------------------------------
B) TRAINING SYSTEM
---------------------------------

Includes:
- Playlists
- Lessons
- Difficulty tiers
- Progress tracking
- Quiz attempts
- Saved state resume
- Mini-game result tracking

Must:
