- Track attempts safely
- Ensure idempotent submissions

---------------------------------
C) AI COACH
---------------------------------

Must:
- Be scoped per user
- Be scoped per config_id
- Prevent cross-user data access
- Log session history safely
- Validate input strictly

---------------------------------
D) SOCIAL SYSTEM
---------------------------------

Includes:
- Public/private channels
- Direct messages
- Friendships
- Blocking
- Admin/mod roles

Must:
